+		/*
+		 * fuse_abort_conn() raised max_background to UINT_MAX, so the
+		 * flush below moves every queued background request to
+		 * fuse_req_queue for ending.  Nothing may sleep on a stopped
+		 * queue's gate: open it and release every waiter.
+		 */
